 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">CATALYTIC ACTIVITY:Reaction=(6R)-5,10-methylene-5,6,7,8-tetrahydrofolate + NAD(+) =5,10-methenyltetrahydrofolate + NADH; Xref=Rhea:RHEA:22892,ChEBI:CHEBI:15636, ChEBI:CHEBI:57455, ChEBI:CHEBI:57540,ChEBI:CHEBI:57945; EC=1.5.1.15;CATALYTIC ACTIVITY:Reaction=5,10-methenyltetrahydrofolate + H2O = (6S)-10-formyltetrahydrofolate + H(+); Xref=Rhea:RHEA:23700,ChEBI:CHEBI:15377, ChEBI:CHEBI:15378, ChEBI:CHEBI:57454,ChEBI:CHEBI:57455; EC=3.5.4.9;COFACTOR:Name=Mg(2+); Xref=ChEBI:CHEBI:18420; Evidence={ECO:0000250};PATHWAY: One-carbon metabolism; tetrahydrofolate interconversion.SUBCELLULAR LOCATION: Mitochondrion inner membrane {ECO:0000250};Peripheral membrane protein {ECO:0000250}; Matrix side{ECO:0000250}.ALTERNATIVE PRODUCTS:Event=Alternative splicing; Named isoforms=5;Name=4;IsoId=Q9H903-4; Sequence=Displayed;Name=1;IsoId=Q9H903-1; Sequence=VSP_041878;Name=2;IsoId=Q9H903-2; Sequence=VSP_041877;Note=No experimental confirmation available.;Name=3;IsoId=Q9H903-3; Sequence=VSP_041878, VSP_041880, VSP_041881;Note=No experimental confirmation available.;Name=5;IsoId=Q9H903-5; Sequence=VSP_041879;TISSUE SPECIFICITY: Isoform 1, isoform 4 and isoform 5 areexpressed in brain and placenta. {ECO:0000269|PubMed:21163947}.SIMILARITY: Belongs to the tetrahydrofolatedehydrogenase/cyclohydrolase family. {ECO:0000305}.SEQUENCE CAUTION:Sequence=AAH32771.1; Type=Erroneous initiation; Note=Translation N-terminally extended.; Evidence={ECO:0000305};Sequence=BAB14441.1; Type=Miscellaneous discrepancy; Note=Contaminating sequence. Sequence of unknown origin in the N-terminal part.; Evidence={ECO:0000305}; COPYRIGHT: UniProt Consortium (www.uniprot.org). Distributed under the Creative Commons Attribution-NoDerivs License.</bp:comment>
